<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Wiring on Chen Kai Blog</title><link>https://www.chenk.top/zh/tags/wiring/</link><description>Recent content in Wiring on Chen Kai Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 08 May 2026 09:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.chenk.top/zh/tags/wiring/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>让 Agent 靠谱起来（4）：部署了，不等于跑起来了</title><link>https://www.chenk.top/zh/reliable-agents/04-deployed-not-executed/</link><pubDate>Fri, 08 May 2026 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.chenk.top/zh/reliable-agents/04-deployed-not-executed/</guid><description>&lt;p>有一种特定味道的自欺，会在你的改动大到有了管线之后冒出来。你写了个功能。你部署了它。部署成功。你标记完成。然后它从没跑过，不是因为它坏了，而是因为在你在乎的那条路上，根本没有东西真正&lt;strong>调用&lt;/strong>它。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>